WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:07.886
This is Pulse, a live globe
of anonymous strangers.

2
00:00:07.936 --> 00:00:08.929
Let's walk through it.

3
00:00:10.256 --> 00:00:14.356
Four phases, weighted fifteen,
thirty, twenty and thirty percent,

4
00:00:14.406 --> 00:00:15.806
plus five for delivery.

5
00:00:16.306 --> 00:00:19.456
Phase one, make it run:
thirteen bugs fixed,

6
00:00:19.506 --> 00:00:23.061
from ghost dots that never left,
to calls that never connected.

7
00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:27.261
Phase two, make it good:
a world-time dial.

8
00:00:27.311 --> 00:00:30.419
You arrive at your own hour,
then tap, Show me who's awake.

9
00:00:30.619 --> 00:00:33.228
Everyone sits on the ring
at their local hour.

10
00:00:33.278 --> 00:00:37.651
Filled is free, hollow is busy,
and scrolling zooms the real map.

11
00:00:37.851 --> 00:00:40.143
Pick someone, see their hour and distance,

12
00:00:40.193 --> 00:00:44.030
and ask to talk. A sweep hand
counts their thirty seconds.

13
00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:46.836
They tap Talk, a red arc joins your hours,

14
00:00:46.886 --> 00:00:50.074
and the chat opens. Either
side can ask for video.

15
00:00:50.974 --> 00:00:54.666
Not now, no answer, or they left:
every ending is spelled out,

16
00:00:54.716 --> 00:00:55.821
and nothing is kept.

17
00:00:56.308 --> 00:00:59.796
Phase three, make it secure:
secret session tokens,

18
00:00:59.846 --> 00:01:03.658
server-enforced calls, rate
limits, on-device location blur,

19
00:01:03.708 --> 00:01:06.808
and a strict content
policy. Forty-two attacks,

20
00:01:06.858 --> 00:01:07.870
all refused.

21
00:01:08.324 --> 00:01:13.286
Phase four, make it better: Daybreak.
Strangers whose sun rises within half

22
00:01:13.336 --> 00:01:16.375
an hour get a horizon on
their mark, and a countdown.

23
00:01:16.675 --> 00:01:20.561
Tap, Watch their sunrise, and a
sky strip tracks their real sun,

24
00:01:20.611 --> 00:01:21.310
to the second.

25
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.251
Every flow works on phones, too.

26
00:01:26.601 --> 00:01:29.694
Public repo, live on Vercel,
notes for every phase.

27
00:01:29.744 --> 00:01:30.574
That's Pulse.
